window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I found my pack. I found my place. Now, I have to fight for both.</b></p> <p>After a lifetime of believing no one would ever want an alpha like me, I've finally found where I belong—with Grif, Jonas, Dean, and AJ. They see me. Choose me. Love me. Not in spite of who I am, but because of it.</p> <p>I thought claiming my pack would be the hardest part. But love doesn't protect us from the world. And the world doesn't know what to do with an alpha who leads with love.</p> <p>My presence has tipped the balance, stirred old rivalries, and made us a target. And if we want our future, we're going to have to fight for it—together.</p> <p>They say alphas are born. But I know better. I built this version of myself from the inside out. And if anyone tries to take what we've built? They'll learn exactly what kind of alpha I've become.</p> <p>Finding the Forward: Part Two <i>is the explosive conclusion to this swoony, high-heat, why-choose omegaverse hockey romance duet featuring a soft-hearted alpha heroine, four fiercely loyal men, pack bonds, male omegas, found family, and a HEA worth everything it took to earn. M/M/M/M/F with steamy scenes, emotional growth, and no playbook.</i></p> <p><i>One lady alpha. Four men. Nothing left to prove. In this pack, we don't let the a-holes win.</i></p>"; 
